  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Finely chop the garlic. Cut the zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Thinly slice the leek. Slice the red onion into thick wedges. Roughly chop the semi-dried tomatoes and kalamata olives.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a805364455236c4d09062a/step-149a7666.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the zucchini, leek, cherry tomatoes and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with the garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a805364455236c4d09062a/step-28b650dc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, cook the farfalle in the boiling water until 'al dente', 11 minutes. Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people), then drain the pasta and return to the saucepan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.\n• TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a805364455236c4d09062a/step-d65f80b8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook the garlic, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the passata, butter, sugar and reserved pasta water and cook until slightly reduced, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a805364455236c4d09062a/step-3751e357.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with the sauce, add the cooked farfalle, roasted veggies, semi-dried tomatoes and kalamata olives. Gently stir to combine and heat through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a805364455236c4d09062a/step-69a688fb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the roast veggie farfalle between bowls. Crumble over the fetta cubes and sprinkle with the flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a805364455236c4d09062a/step-08d732eb.jpg"
    }
  ]
